<tr id="S2.T2.5.2" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S2.T2.5.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t">
<span id="S2.T2.5.2.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:56.9pt;">
<span id="S2.T2.5.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">Price Inquiry</span>
</span></td>
<td id="S2.T2.5.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t">
<span id="S2.T2.5.2.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:119.5pt;">
<span id="S2.T2.5.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">What was NVIDIA’s closing price on March 15, 2022?</span>
</span></td>
<td id="S2.T2.5.2.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t">
<span id="S2.T2.5.2.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:108.1pt;">
<span id="S2.T2.5.2.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">$229.73</span>
</span></td>
<td id="S2.T2.5.2.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t">
<span id="S2.T2.5.2.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:156.5pt;">
